{"name":"The Singlepass Sign","slug":"glyph-singlepass-sign","blurb":"On the voice street, Yuri carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Singlepass. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Singlepass Sign.","seal":"2b49e2df7635d223646fd3bbf9cd7f70cc20611a0e4e7dc9756bd9ba6cc56eff"}
